  - {fileID: 8483840616155112445}
  npcs:
  - npcName: Maanulsen
    description: Maanulsen is doing his job of protecting the power plant, so how
      did anybody even get in?
    lockedText: This NPC is locked.
    isUnlocked: 0
  - npcName: Otaah
    description: Otaah has been doing something on the teleporter, he claims he was
      with somebody called Azneeh. I should speak to him at 'Planet B's teleporter.
    lockedText: This NPC is locked.
    isUnlocked: 0
  - npcName: Tikai
    description: Tikai is very defensive and couldn't prove his innocence. Instead,
      he questions me and my work.
    lockedText: This NPC is locked.
    isUnlocked: 0
  - npcName: Azneeh
    description: Azneeh has been doing something with the cables. He claims he was
      with Otaah, so I should investigate him next.
    lockedText: This NPC is locked.
    isUnlocked: 0
